## `story.ni:11190` — the source's `dance` refusal, true again.

define action dancing
  grammar
    dance
    dance with the target
  the target is a topic
  phrase never-danced-before

define phrase never-danced-before
  You may be nimble on your feet in a tight spot, but you've never danced
  before and you're far too self-conscious to start now.
end phrase

