create the guests
  aka guest, crowd, crowds, people, partygoer, partygoers, party goers, party goer, high society, extravagant costumes, costumes
  scenery, plural

  The guests are all the brightest, richest, and most beautiful in Toresal.
  They laugh and chatter and compliment each other on their extravagant
  costumes and jewelry. Amidst all the gaeity and ostentatious wealth, you
  can't help but feel a little bit self-conscious and plain.

