  The Prince cuts such a striking figure, you can't imagine how you failed
  to notice him until now. Tall and slim, with smooth skin the color of
  strong tea and long, ink-black hair tied back at the nape of his neck. His
  clothes, though finely cut, are black as well, devoid of decoration except
  for a single garnet brooch pinning his cloak at the shoulder. He looks
  young, perhaps only a few years older than you. And something about his
  deep, brown eyes makes it difficult for you to concentrate...

